{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>屯門鳴琴路發生車禍。（fb「屯門友」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>屯門鳴琴路發生車禍。 今日（22日）早上約8時15分，兩輛九巴於屯門鳴琴路、往良景邨方向，近山景邨景業樓對開位置相撞。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，據了解，兩輛巴士上有4男5女共9人受輕傷，包括兩名車長，由救護車送往屯門醫院治理。警方正在調查車禍起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:22:40.861359+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:53.750174+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:18:00.116445+00:00","content_hash":"4da7e21110bd97265abcf3480e3317029c39ae0ed0da67ee27d70047541691e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}